  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">此模組允許以下實體：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">《守護村民》（Guard Villagers）中的守衛；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">《村民新兵》（Villager Recruits）中的弩手。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">可在以下模組中使用槍械：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfishs-gun-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CGM</a>；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfishs-gun-mod-unofficial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CGMu</a>（1.20.1+）；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classic-guns-tac\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Timeless and Classics</a>（1.18.2）。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">注意</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">你<span style=\"color:#9c0\"><strong>絕對可以</strong></span>將此模組加入你的整合包中。</span></p>",
